      "start_seconds": 4.72,
      "end_seconds": 5.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Hi there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 6.37,
      "end_seconds": 13.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Ah, doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.44,
      "end_seconds": 20.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "right, tell me what's brought you in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.21,
      "end_seconds": 26.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "well, um, I've been having constant worrying"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.41,
      "end_seconds": 31.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Right, time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.28,
      "end_seconds": 44.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.71,
      "end_seconds": 64.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, pulse is 70 beats a minute, respiratory rate 14, pressure 128 over 76, temperature is 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.18,
      "end_seconds": 67.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.5,
      "end_seconds": 73.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.97,
      "end_seconds": 79.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "it's, It's been going on for five days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.3,
      "end_seconds": 84.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.87,
      "end_seconds": 105.01,
      "duration_seconds": 19.14,
      "text": "erm, it feels mild to me i've also had trouble sleeping about trouble sleeping, it feels mild to me i've been feeling on edge too, for about a month about feeling on edge, I'd say severe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.49,
      "end_seconds": 111.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Any thoughts of harming myself, chest pain on exertion or drinking more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.7,
      "end_seconds": 121.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "I haven't had thoughts of harming myself, chest pain on exertion or drinking more, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.32,
      "end_seconds": 125.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Any sign of weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.71,
      "end_seconds": 128.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "no no weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.23,
      "end_seconds": 133.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.16,
      "end_seconds": 137.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.72,
      "end_seconds": 143.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.56,
      "end_seconds": 151.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "It's, It's metoprolol, 50 milligrams, maybe, twice a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.37,
      "end_seconds": 157.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.06,
      "end_seconds": 170.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.36,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Sorry, what was I saying, I take lisinopril, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.47,
      "end_seconds": 174.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.02,
      "end_seconds": 182.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "So, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.66,
      "end_seconds": 199.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.61,
      "end_seconds": 206.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "I'm allergic to milk, I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.17,
      "end_seconds": 224.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.18,
      "end_seconds": 233.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat, yes. High blood pressure, for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.83,
      "end_seconds": 242.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "right, so high blood pressure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.08,
      "end_seconds": 261.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.48,
      "end_seconds": 266.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.35,
      "end_seconds": 268.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.92,
      "end_seconds": 273.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.4,
      "end_seconds": 276.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.52,
      "end_seconds": 282.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.14,
      "end_seconds": 285.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.99,
      "end_seconds": 290.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.31,
      "end_seconds": 294.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.77,
      "end_seconds": 299.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.12,
      "end_seconds": 305.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.97,
      "end_seconds": 308.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "let me feel here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.47,
      "end_seconds": 326.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Your heart sounds are normal and your thyroid feels normal in size."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.6,
      "end_seconds": 351.5,
      "duration_seconds": 21.9,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably generalised anxiety. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I think a thyroid test makes sense here, for anxiety symptoms. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.66,
      "end_seconds": 354.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.92,
      "end_seconds": 389.72,
      "duration_seconds": 34.8,
      "text": "Let's use sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day, long term. You take it by mouth. That's for anxiety. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Try slow breathing and regular exercise, and limit caffeine. I'm gonna send a referral to the talking therapy service. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.68,
      "end_seconds": 394.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I'd like you back in four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.76,
      "end_seconds": 401.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Mm, I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.94,
      "end_seconds": 406.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 408.26,
      "end_seconds": 411.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.97,
